{"crc":"1a2fa844","kind":"Candidate","payload":{"response":"To fix the issue of duplicate key values in the `auth_permission` table during migration, we need to ensure that the permissions for proxy models are not being recreated unnecessarily. This can be achieved by modifying the migration script to check if a permission already exists before creating it.\n\nHere's how you can update the migration file:\n\n# path: tests/generic_views/migrations/0011_update_proxy_permissions.py\n```\nfrom django.db import migrations, models\n\nclass Migration(migrations.Migration):\n\n    dependencies = [\n        ('generic_views', '0010_auto_20230401_1234'),\n    ]\n\n    operations = [\n        migrations.RunPython(\n            code=create_proxy_permissions,\n            reverse_code=migrations.RunPython.noop,\n        ),\n    ]\n\n\ndef create_proxy_permissions(apps, schema_editor):\n    Permission = apps.get_model('auth', 'Permission')\n    ContentType = apps.get_model('contenttypes', 'ContentType')\n\n    # Define the permissions to be created\n    permissions_to_create = [\n        ('add_agency', 'Can add agency'),\n        ('change_agency', 'Can change agency'),\n        ('delete_agency', 'Can delete agency'),\n        # Add other permissions as needed\n    ]\n\n    for codename, name in permissions_to_create:\n        content_type, created = ContentType.objects.get_or_create(\n            app_label='generic_views',\n            model='agency'\n        )\n        if not Permission.objects.filter(content_type=content_type, codename=codename).exists():\n            Permission.objects.create(\n                content_type=content_type,\n                codename=codename,\n                name=name\n            )\n\n```\n\nThis script ensures that each permission is only created if it does not already exist in the `auth_permission` table. This should prevent the `IntegrityError` and allow the migration to complete successfully.\n\nMake sure to replace `'generic_views'` with the actual app label of your project where the `Agency` model is defined.","round":1,"slot":0},"producer":{"instance":"01KZS7FC8D5Y217KB07TZN84GQ","kind":"drafter","parent":"01KZS7FC884XSQ59HKHFJHPQD7"},"schema":"Candidate@1","seq":14,"t":1786479451.698393}
